---
/* Manual carousel. No scroll-driven state. */
---

<section id="problem-finding-story" class="section border-t border-line">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="reveal max-w-[62rem]">
      <p class="eyebrow">01</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">How do you find the real problem?</h2>
      <div class="prose-hera mt-6 max-w-[50rem]">
        <p>
          I usually start by asking one thing:
          <strong>what is the user carrying that the product should be carrying instead?</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-carousel reveal" data-story-carousel tabindex="0">
      <button class="nav-arrow prev" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous idea" hidden>←</button>

      <div class="slides" aria-live="polite">

        <article class="slide active" data-slide="0" aria-hidden="false">
          <div class="slide1-layout">
            <div class="slide1-copy">
              <p class="kicker">The HERA story</p>
              <p class="slide1-bold">
                I thought the problem was managing agents. It turned out the problem was everything I had to remember for them.
              </p>
              <p class="slide1-body">
                AI agents could already ask questions, use tools, and work for long periods. But I was still remembering which file was current, what I had already decided, what another agent had learned, which version had been reviewed, and whether I had answered the same question before.
              </p>
              <p class="slide1-body">
                HERA started because I kept feeling that exact problem while working with AI.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="brain-canvas" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="brain-glow"></div>
              <div class="brain-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M12 18V5" />
                  <path d="M15 13a4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3-4 4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3 4" />
                  <path d="M17.598 6.5A3 3 0 1 0 12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.598 1.5" />
                  <path d="M17.997 5.125a4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77" />
                  <path d="M18 18a4 4 0 0 0 2-7.464" />
                  <path d="M19.967 17.483A4 4 0 1 1 12 18a4 4 0 1 1-7.967-.517" />
                  <path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-2-7.464" />
                  <path d="M6.003 5.125a4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="thought t-top-left">What sprint are we on?</div>
              <div class="thought t-top-center">Which subagent owns that slice?</div>
              <div class="thought t-mid-right">What context is still missing?</div>
              <div class="thought t-bot-center">Did I already share the last build closeout?</div>
              <div class="thought t-bot-left">What did the verifier approve?</div>
              <div class="thought t-mid-left">Which file is the current version?</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" data-slide="1" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="copy">
            <p class="kicker">What I questioned</p>
            <h3>Why should an intelligent product keep asking me to act as its memory?</h3>
            <p>
              If I already told a friend I went to Ibiza, I expect the next useful question
              to be “who did you go with?”, not “where did you travel?”
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="stage ibiza-stage">
            <p class="stage-label">A simple trust test</p>
            <div class="two-col">
              <div class="side">
                <small class="time">EARLIER</small>
                <div class="bubble"><small>YOU</small><p>I just got back from Ibiza.</p></div>
                <div class="memory"><div><small>TRIP</small><strong>Ibiza</strong></div><b>✓</b></div>
              </div>

              <div class="side">
                <small class="time">LATER</small>
                <div class="bubble wrong"><small>AI</small><p>Where did you travel?</p><em>already known</em></div>
                <div class="divider"><span></span><small>context checked</small><span></span></div>
                <div class="bubble right"><small>AI</small><p>Who did you travel with?</p><em>not found → ask</em></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" data-slide="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="copy">
            <p class="kicker">What I realized</p>
            <h3>The bottleneck was not simply model intelligence. It was trust.</h3>
            <p>
              If the AI interrupts me, I need to trust that it checked what I already gave it first.
              An interruption should earn the right to interrupt me.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="stage trust-stage">
            <p class="stage-label">Before a question reaches me</p>
            <div class="trust-flow">
              <div class="question"><span>?</span><strong>Need an answer</strong></div>
              <div class="line"></div>

              <div class="checks">
                <span style="--i:0">DECISIONS <b>✓</b></span>
                <span style="--i:1">FILES <b>✓</b></span>
                <span style="--i:2">PREVIOUS WORK <b>✓</b></span>
                <span style="--i:3">CONVERSATION <b>✓</b></span>
                <span style="--i:4">ACCEPTED RESULT <b>✓</b></span>
              </div>

              <div class="line"></div>

              <div class="gate">
                <small>CAN THE SYSTEM RESOLVE THIS?</small>
                <div><span class="yes"><b>YES</b> continue working</span><span class="no"><b>NO</b> human meaning required</span></div>
              </div>

              <div class="human-arrival"><span class="human-dot"></span><div><small>YOU</small><strong>Only when the answer is genuinely yours</strong></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" data-slide="3" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="copy">
            <p class="kicker">The product decision</p>
            <h3>Make context part of the product, not something hidden inside a prompt.</h3>
            <p>
              The person should provide meaning and judgment. The product should carry the context,
              state, history, work, and evidence around it.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="stage transfer-stage">
            <p class="stage-label">Move the burden into the product</p>
            <div class="transfer">
              <div class="transfer-card">
                <div class="who"><span class="human-dot"></span><div><small>HUMAN</small><strong>Meaning + judgment</strong></div></div>
                <div class="keep"><span>INTENT</span><span>JUDGMENT</span></div>
              </div>

              <div class="move"><span></span><b>→</b></div>

              <div class="transfer-card">
                <div class="who"><span class="ai-dot">✦</span><div><small>PRODUCT</small><strong>Carry the workflow</strong></div></div>
                <div class="product-list">
                  <span style="--i:0">CONTEXT</span>
                  <span style="--i:1">STATE</span>
                  <span style="--i:2">HISTORY</span>
                  <span style="--i:3">WORK</span>
                  <span style="--i:4">EVIDENCE</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="return"><small>only unresolved meaning crosses back</small><strong>What do <em>you</em> want?</strong></div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

      <button class="nav-arrow next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next idea">→</button>

      <div class="footer">
        <span data-count>1 / 4</span>
        <div class="dots"><i class="active" data-dot="0"></i><i data-dot="1"></i><i data-dot="2"></i><i data-dot="3"></i></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="outro reveal">
      <p>
        That is usually how I work: I follow the friction until I can describe the burden
        <strong>the user should never have been carrying in the first place.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story-carousel{position:relative;margin-top:clamp(54px,8vw,92px);padding:0 clamp(0px,4vw,56px);outline:none}
  .slides{max-width:980px;margin:auto}
  .slide{display:none}.slide.active{display:block;animation:slideIn .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.82,.2,1)}
  @keyframes slideIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

  /* Shared kicker style (used across all slides) */
  .kicker{margin:0 0 9px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.085em;text-transform:uppercase}

  /* ── SLIDE 1 LAYOUT ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .slide1-layout{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:42% 58%;
    gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);
    align-items:center;
    min-height:440px;
  }
  .slide1-copy{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:0;
    padding:clamp(12px,2vw,24px) 0;
  }
  .slide1-bold{
    margin:10px 0 0;
    color:var(--ink);
    font-size:clamp(1.1rem,1.6vw,1.35rem);
    line-height:1.45;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:-.02em;
  }
  .slide1-body{
    margin:14px 0 0;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:1rem;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  /* ── BRAIN CANVAS ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .brain-canvas{
    position:relative;
    min-height:460px;
    border-radius:24px;
    background:#0c0c0d;
    overflow:hidden;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }

  /* Warm stress glow behind the brain */
  .brain-glow{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .brain-glow::after{
    content:'';
    width:180px;
    height:180px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(220,80,50,.28) 0%,rgba(220,80,50,.08) 45%,transparent 70%);
    animation:glowPulse 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes glowPulse{
    0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.7}
    50%{transform:scale(1.28);opacity:1}
  }

  /* Brain icon */
  .brain-icon{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    width:96px;
    height:96px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);
    animation:brainPulse 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
    flex:none;
  }
  .brain-icon svg{width:100%;height:100%}
  @keyframes brainPulse{
    0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}
    50%{transform:scale(1.055)}
  }

  /* Floating thought chips */
  .thought{
    position:absolute;
    z-index:3;
    padding:7px 14px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.065);
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);
    font-size:.71rem;
    line-height:1.3;
    white-space:nowrap;
    opacity:0;
  }
  .slide.active .thought{
    opacity:1;
    transition:opacity .5s ease .3s;
  }
  /* Individual thought positions + drift animations */
  .t-top-left   { top:13%;  left:6%;  animation:drift1 11s ease-in-out 0s    infinite alternate; }
  .t-top-center { top:10%;  left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); animation:drift2 13s ease-in-out -3.5s  infinite alternate; }
  .t-mid-right  { top:46%;  right:5%; animation:drift3 14s ease-in-out -7s   infinite alternate; white-space:normal; max-width:160px; }
  .t-bot-center { bottom:12%; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); animation:drift4 12s ease-in-out -2s   infinite alternate; white-space:normal; max-width:200px; }
  .t-bot-left   { bottom:14%; left:5%; animation:drift5 15s ease-in-out -9s   infinite alternate; }
  .t-mid-left   { top:46%;  left:5%; animation:drift6 10s ease-in-out -5s   infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes drift1{ 0%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(5px,-7px)} 100%{transform:translate(-4px,5px)} }
  @keyframes drift2{ 0%{transform:translateX(-50%) translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translateX(-50%) translate(5px,6px)} 100%{transform:translateX(-50%) translate(-6px,-4px)} }
  @keyframes drift3{ 0%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(-4px,8px)} 100%{transform:translate(5px,-6px)} }
  @keyframes drift4{ 0%{transform:translateX(-50%) translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translateX(-50%) translate(-5px,-6px)} 100%{transform:translateX(-50%) translate(4px,4px)} }
  @keyframes drift5{ 0%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(6px,-5px)} 100%{transform:translate(-3px,7px)} }
  @keyframes drift6{ 0%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(-6px,6px)} 100%{transform:translate(5px,-4px)} }

  /* ── SHARED (slides 2-4 unchanged) ──────────────────────── */
  /* Legacy copy/stage styles kept for slides 2-4 */
  .copy{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:26px}
  .copy h3{margin:0;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.65rem);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:620}
  .copy>p:last-child{max-width:650px;margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}

  .stage{min-height:440px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 8%,rgba(216,189,111,.065),transparent 30%),var(--surface);box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}
  .stage-label{height:52px;margin:0;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}

  .nav-arrow{position:absolute;top:55%;z-index:5;width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font-size:1.2rem;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}
  .prev{left:0}.next{right:0}.nav-arrow[hidden]{display:none}
  .footer{max-width:980px;margin:16px auto 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem}
  .dots{display:flex;gap:7px}.dots i{width:18px;height:2px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--line);transition:.25s}.dots i.active{width:30px;background:var(--ink)}

  .two-col{min-height:388px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(28px,6vw,74px);padding:clamp(32px,5vw,54px);align-items:center}
  .side{min-width:0}
  .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.who small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.56rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.1em}.who strong{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--ink);font-size:.76rem}
  .human-dot{width:38px;height:38px;display:block;flex:none;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 22%,var(--line));border-radius:50%;background:var(--surface)}
  .ai-dot{width:38px;height:38px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(216,189,111,.15);color:#d8bd6f}

  .chip-list{margin-top:26px;display:grid;gap:8px}.chip-list span{width:max-content;max-width:100%;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;color:var(--ink);font-size:.6rem;font-weight:700;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-10px)}
  .slide.active .chip-list span{animation:arrive .35s ease forwards;animation-delay:calc(var(--i)*100ms + 130ms)}
  @keyframes arrive{to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .total{margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;opacity:0}.slide.active .total{animation:fadeUp .35s ease .75s forwards}.total b{font-size:1.55rem}.total span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem}

  .ai-side{text-align:center}.ai-who{justify-content:center}.working{margin:26px auto 0;max-width:220px;padding:12px;border-radius:13px;background:rgba(216,189,111,.07);color:var(--muted);font-size:.66rem}.working i{display:block;width:38%;height:2px;margin:0 auto 8px;background:#d8bd6f;animation:work 1.6s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
  @keyframes work{from{transform:translateX(-42%);opacity:.45}to{transform:translateX(42%);opacity:1}}

  .time{display:block;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--faint);font-size:.56rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.12em}
  .bubble{padding:13px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)}.bubble small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.54rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.09em}.bubble p{margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--ink);font-size:.82rem}.bubble em{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.58rem;font-style:normal}
  .memory{width:150px;margin:17px 0 0 auto;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-radius:13px;background:rgba(174,224,189,.1);opacity:0}.memory small,.memory strong{display:block}.memory small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.5rem}.memory strong{font-size:.7rem}.memory b{color:#aee0bd}.slide.active .memory{animation:fadeUp .35s ease .3s forwards}
  .wrong{opacity:0}.slide.active .wrong{animation:wrong 1.35s ease .55s forwards}@keyframes wrong{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(7px)}30%,70%{opacity:1;transform:none}100%{opacity:.3;text-decoration:line-through}}
  .divider{margin:12px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;opacity:0}.divider span{height:1px;flex:1;background:var(--line)}.divider small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.5rem}.slide.active .divider{animation:fade .2s ease 1.4s forwards}
  .right{opacity:0;border-color:rgba(216,189,111,.28)}.slide.active .right{animation:fadeUp .35s ease 1.7s forwards}

  .trust-flow{min-height:388px;padding:28px clamp(24px,5vw,54px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
  .question{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:9px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px}.question span{width:22px;height:22px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(216,189,111,.13)}.question strong{font-size:.66rem}
  .line{width:1px;height:32px;background:linear-gradient(var(--line),#d8bd6f);transform-origin:top;transform:scaleY(0)}.slide.active .line{animation:grow .3s ease .2s forwards}.slide.active .line:nth-of-type(2){animation-delay:1.2s}@keyframes grow{to{transform:scaleY(1)}}
  .checks{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:7px}.checks span{padding:10px 4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.46rem;font-weight:700;opacity:.2}.checks b{display:block;width:17px;height:17px;margin:6px auto 0;border-radius:50%;color:#aee0bd;background:rgba(174,224,189,.1);opacity:0}.slide.active .checks span{animation:wake .28s ease forwards;animation-delay:calc(var(--i)*100ms + .45s)}.slide.active .checks b{animation:fade .2s ease forwards;animation-delay:calc(var(--i)*100ms + .58s)}@keyframes wake{to{opacity:1}}
  .gate{width:min(500px,100%);opacity:0}.slide.active .gate{animation:fadeUp .3s ease 1.45s forwards}.gate>small{display:block;margin-bottom:7px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.5rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.08em}.gate>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}.gate span{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;font-size:.58rem}.gate b{margin-right:5px}.yes{background:rgba(174,224,189,.09);color:#aee0bd}.no{background:rgba(216,189,111,.09);color:var(--ink)}
  .human-arrival{margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;opacity:0}.slide.active .human-arrival{animation:fadeUp .3s ease 1.8s forwards}.human-arrival .human-dot{width:30px;height:30px}.human-arrival small,.human-arrival strong{display:block}.human-arrival small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.5rem}.human-arrival strong{font-size:.62rem}

  .transfer{min-height:330px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 72px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:clamp(28px,5vw,52px);padding-bottom:16px}.transfer-card{min-height:235px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:var(--surface)}
  .keep,.product-list{margin-top:20px;display:grid;gap:8px}.keep span,.product-list span{padding:9px 10px;border-radius:9px;font-size:.55rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em}.keep span{background:rgba(159,199,255,.08)}.product-list span{background:rgba(216,189,111,.08);opacity:0;transform:translateX(-9px)}.slide.active .product-list span{animation:arrive .3s ease forwards;animation-delay:calc(var(--i)*110ms + .75s)}
  .move{position:relative;height:1px}.move span{display:block;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line),#d8bd6f);transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0)}.slide.active .move span{animation:across .42s ease .35s forwards}@keyframes across{to{transform:scaleX(1)}}.move b{position:absolute;right:-2px;top:-11px;color:#d8bd6f;opacity:0}.slide.active .move b{animation:fade .2s ease .72s forwards}
  .return{max-width:350px;margin:0 auto 24px;padding:10px 13px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(216,189,111,.22);border-radius:12px;opacity:0}.slide.active .return{animation:fadeUp .35s ease 1.55s forwards}.return small,.return strong{display:block}.return small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.5rem}.return strong{margin-top:3px;font-size:.7rem}.return em{font-style:normal;color:#d8bd6f}

  .outro{max-width:56rem;margin-top:clamp(46px,7vw,80px)}.outro p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(1.16rem,2vw,1.6rem);line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.02em}.outro strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:620}
  @keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(7px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}@keyframes fade{to{opacity:1}}

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media(max-width:820px){
    .story-carousel{padding:0}.nav-arrow{top:auto;bottom:0}.footer{min-height:44px;padding:0 56px}.stage{min-height:460px}.two-col{padding:28px}.checks{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
    /* Slide 1 responsive */
    .slide1-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px;min-height:auto}
    .brain-canvas{min-height:320px}
  }
  @media(max-width:620px){
    .copy h3{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,7vw,2rem)}.two-col,.transfer{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.ai-side{text-align:left}.ai-who{justify-content:flex-start}.memory{margin-left:0}.transfer-card{min-height:auto}.move{width:1px;height:26px;margin:auto}.move span{width:1px;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(var(--line),#d8bd6f);transform-origin:top;transform:scaleY(0)}.slide.active .move span{animation:grow .35s ease .35s forwards}.move b{right:-7px;top:17px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.stage{min-height:520px}
    /* Slide 1 mobile thought chips — allow wrap */
    .thought{white-space:normal;max-width:140px;text-align:center;font-size:.67rem}
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .slide.active,.chip-list span,.total,.memory,.wrong,.divider,.right,.line,.checks span,.checks b,.gate,.human-arrival,.product-list span,.move span,.move b,.return{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
    .chip-list span,.total,.memory,.wrong,.divider,.right,.checks span,.checks b,.gate,.human-arrival,.product-list span,.move b,.return{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}.line,.move span{transform:none!important}.working i{animation:none!important}
    .brain-glow::after,.brain-icon,.thought{animation:none!important}
    .slide.active .thought{opacity:1!important;transition:none!important}
  }
</style>

<script>
  const carousel = document.querySelector('[data-story-carousel]');
  if (carousel) {
    const slides = Array.from(carousel.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]'));
    const prev = carousel.querySelector('[data-prev]');
    const next = carousel.querySelector('[data-next]');
    const count = carousel.querySelector('[data-count]');
    const dots = Array.from(carousel.querySelectorAll('[data-dot]'));
    let current = 0;

    const show = (index) => {
      current = Math.max(0, Math.min(slides.length - 1, index));

      slides.forEach((slide, i) => {
        const active = i === current;
        slide.classList.remove('active');
        slide.setAttribute('aria-hidden', active ? 'false' : 'true');
        if (active) {
          void slide.offsetWidth;
          slide.classList.add('active');
        }
      });

      dots.forEach((dot, i) => dot.classList.toggle('active', i === current));
      if (count) count.textContent = `${current + 1} / ${slides.length}`;
      if (prev) prev.hidden = current === 0;
      if (next) next.hidden = current === slides.length - 1;
    };

    prev?.addEventListener('click', () => show(current - 1));
    next?.addEventListener('click', () => show(current + 1));

    carousel.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
      if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft' && current > 0) { event.preventDefault(); show(current - 1); }
      if (event.key === 'ArrowRight' && current < slides.length - 1) { event.preventDefault(); show(current + 1); }
    });

    show(0);
  }
</script>
